            <history xml:id="history_d66f6ac4">
               <p xml:id="idm116">Nothing is known about the genesis of this work. In the original edition it is without an opus number; when Wilhelm Hansen republished it in the late 1880s, however, it was provided with the opus number 48. Niels Krabbe has suggested that it was a misinterpretation of the price "48 Sk." printed on the original edition.</p>
            </history>
